      "text": "Flight controller \n1. what is flight controller ?\n    it is the brain and heart of the flight.\n2. what components it incorporates in it?\n mcu, battery, connectors for different modules like sensors data gps data motor controller data etc.\n3. how to implement it?\n     circuit design  ",
